; opsapi.org — records for the `demo` identity stack on k3s1.
; Import into Cloudflare (DNS > Records > Import) or apply one by one with
; devops/scripts/cloudflare-dns.sh (see README.md step 2).
;
; Each name is a CNAME to the wslproxy edge (lon1.pop0.uk), DNS-only (NOT
; proxied / grey cloud): the edge requests its own Let's Encrypt cert per
; host and terminates TLS, then proxies to k3s1 traefik-edge by Host header.
; Same layout as the *-opsapi.workstation.co.uk hosts.
;
;   browser -> <host>.demo.opsapi.org --CNAME--> lon1.pop0.uk (edge, TLS)
;           -> 193.237.176.232:8888 (k3s1 traefik-edge) -> pods in ns `demo`
$ORIGIN opsapi.org.
$TTL 300

identity.demo     300  IN  CNAME  lon1.pop0.uk.   ; OpsAPI API (opsapi-demo)
dashboard.demo    300  IN  CNAME  lon1.pop0.uk.   ; OpsAPI admin UI (opsapi-demo-dashboard)
hello-java.demo   300  IN  CNAME  lon1.pop0.uk.   ; demo Spring Boot client
hello-php.demo    300  IN  CNAME  lon1.pop0.uk.   ; demo PHP client
